# A fixture file's BYTES are the document: the manifest records a sha256 over the file itself.
# Line-ending churn here is corpus corruption, not formatting. The documents carry no newline, so
# normalisation is a no-op today; this keeps it so by rule, against any broader parent rule.
*.json -text

# The index is a formatted document for humans, emitted with LF line endings.
manifest.json text eol=lf

# The emitter, the reader and the checker are ordinary source.
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.md  text eol=lf
